SUMMARY:What the Heck Is Fabric IQ?
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nACFabric IQ sounds important\, but 
 what is it actually doing? We’ll break down how it uses business context
  to help AI understand your data\, how Copilot fits in\, and what grounded
  answers could look like in real work. Bring your questions.\n\nFor more i
 nformation on Data Days and all it has to offer\, visit https://aka.ms/Dat
 aDays
