SUMMARY:Stop Reporting the Plan. Start Planning in Fabric
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nReporting tells you what already ha
 ppened. Planning is about deciding what happens next.\n\nWe’ll work thro
 ugh a practical scenario that connects actuals\, forecasts\, decisions\, a
 nd action inside Fabric.\n\nFor more information on Data Days and all it h
 as to offer\, visit https://aka.ms/DataDays
