SUMMARY:New Year\, New Bot - Give Your Bot an Agentic Brain
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nBuild an agentic AI experience with
  the GitHub Copilot SDK\, integrating the agent with the .NET and Aspire b
 ackend and the M5Stack StackChan.\n\nExplore agent behaviors and tool use\
 , then connect the software to the robot so it can respond through its dis
 play and movements.\n\nThis session demonstrates how an SDK-driven agent c
 an power a physical AI companion.
