SUMMARY:Fabric IQ in Action: Ask\, Understand\, Act
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nLet’s put Fabric IQ to work on a 
 real business question. We’ll look at how it uses context to produce a g
 rounded answer\, how someone checks that answer\, and what it takes to tur
 n the result into a useful next step.\n\n📌 This event is part of a seri
 es. Learn more here:\nhttps://aka.ms/DataDays/FabConRecap/y\nhttps://aka.m
 s/DataDays/IntoCerts/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/UnderstandIt/y\nhttps://ak
